  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Short Span Bridges on Rural Road Network in Sri Lanka</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Construction of 200 rural bridges, contribution to an all-weather safe rural road infrastructure in Sri Lanka. Increasing the robustness of the infrastructure will allow people to increase their participation in the economy. This will lead to better livelihoods, improved well-being and will have long-term beneficial outcomes through improved education and health of the dependants of families.</narrative>
  </description>
